WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.072 --> 00:00:04.999
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.640
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.641 --> 00:00:10.217
They see a home store.

4
00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:13.943
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:13.944 --> 00:00:41.354
They go into a living room.

6
00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:57.744
They go into a dining room.

7
00:00:57.745 --> 00:01:18.009
They go into a kitchen.

8
00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:40.073
They go into a playroom.

9
00:01:40.074 --> 00:02:03.837
They go into a bathroom.

10
00:02:03.838 --> 00:02:23.076
They go into a bedroom.

11
00:02:23.077 --> 00:02:35.574
They have a big teddy bear.

12
00:02:35.575 --> 00:02:42.687
They love the teddy bear.

13
00:02:42.688 --> 00:02:45.201
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:45.202 --> 00:02:46.953
Good-bye!

